@dir include/micro-os-plus/micro-test-plus/inlines
@brief Folder with C++ header files containing inline µTest++ implementations.

@details
This folder holds the definitions of the inline functions and of the
templates declared in the headers of the parent folder, in files named
after them, with the `-inlines` suffix: the check results, counters,
deprecated definitions, shared templates, exception checks, expression
formatter, function comparators, mathematical helpers, reflection,
reporters, runner and its options, stopwatch, test suites and test cases,
and string utilities.

The contents of this folder are intended solely for internal use within
the library and should not be included directly by user code.
